  "title": "A Focus on Family During Black History Month",
  "summary": "A fond memory of Patrick C.’s childhood is helping his great-grandfather on the farm. In 1967, at the tender age of nine, he killed his first hog. Some might say because of that unique experience he was destined to become a Meat Manager. During Black History Month, Patrick has graciously agreed to share why […]",
